msgid "Enter the port counts in the controller order you selected, for example 4,4. Use independently verified port counts, not the number of connected disks. Each count must be 1 through 9."
msgstr "Enter the port counts in the controller order you selected, for example 4,4. Use independently verified port counts, not the number of connected disks. Each count must be 1 through 9."

