msgstr "Other storage controller (not included in SATA candidate)"

#: MSGZZ249
msgid "PCI listing order and connected disk counts do not establish DSM controller order, available port counts, boot disk, SAS index placement or physical bays. Verify all of these before entering a candidate."
msgstr "PCI listing order and connected disk counts do not establish DSM controller order, available port counts, boot disk, SAS index placement or physical bays. Verify all of these before entering a candidate."

#: MSGZZ250
msgid "Enter controller numbers in verified DSM order. Press Enter to keep the displayed order. Loader order is not proof of DSM order."
msgstr "Enter controller numbers in verified DSM order. Press Enter to keep the displayed order. Loader order is not proof of DSM order."

#: MSGZZ251
msgid "The default values are suggested from the detected disk counts above. They are not verified port counts; verify the available ports and include empty ports if required."
msgstr "The default values are suggested from the detected disk counts above. They are not verified port counts; verify the available ports and include empty ports if required."

